<section class="section section-pad" id="platform" style="background:transparent;">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-kicker">Platform</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading">From formal model to operational service.</h2>
    <p class="section-sub" style="max-width:70ch;">
      PolarisChain materialises the graph model as a software platform: an ingestion layer that
      populates the graph automatically from real X.509 artifacts, a governance-aware graph engine,
      and an API consumed by each domain's validation services.
    </p>

    <div class="platform-grid">
      <article class="challenge-card platform-card platform-card-gold">
        <div class="platform-card-num">01</div>
        <h3>Discover</h3>
        <p>
          Given a certificate or an origin-destination pair, return the admissible certification
          paths together with the real artifacts: the concrete cross-certificates, ready to install
          in a trust store or embed in a signed document. Path discovery as a service, in the
          lineage of SCVP (RFC&nbsp;5055).
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="challenge-card platform-card">
        <div class="platform-card-num">02</div>
        <h3>Govern</h3>
        <p>
          What-if analysis before signing an edge: if we cross-certify at SubCA level with
          pathLenConstraint&nbsp;2 and these name constraints, what becomes reachable? Which
          unintended transitive trust appears? The model as a decision tool, not just a lookup.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="challenge-card platform-card">
        <div class="platform-card-num">03</div>
        <h3>Audit</h3>
        <p>
          Visualise how far the trust of a nation or organisation propagates. Detect expired or
          revoked edges, insufficient path lengths, missing name constraints — and verify every
          relation is used for the scope it was designed for.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="platform-flow" role="list">
      <div class="platform-flow-step" role="listitem">Harvest X.509 artifacts</div>
      <div class="platform-flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="platform-flow-step" role="listitem">Populate governed graph</div>
      <div class="platform-flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="platform-flow-step" role="listitem">Query reachability</div>
      <div class="platform-flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="platform-flow-step" role="listitem">
        Admissible path + artifacts, or exact failure diagnosis
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="platform-flow-caption">
      Designed for interconnected multi-nation environments such as coalition interoperability
      exercises.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

